    "title": "NCAA Division I Friday field hockey games: teams, times, how to watch - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Guest Author ,\n1 days ago The NCAA Division I field hockey slate on Friday features 27 games and 14 ranked teams, highlighted by four head-to-head matchups between NFHCA Top 20 programs. No. 1 Northwestern and No. 2 Maryland anchor the afternoon against Michigan State and Rutgers, while the mid-day brings No. 11 Syracuse to No. 9 Virginia, No. 5 Duke to No. 3 Wake Forest, No. 12 Louisville to No. 17 California and No. 14 Liberty to No. 7 UConn. Read full article",
